# „Bus 150?" board, a run-jump onto the `?`-box at 17 and onto the vitrine,
# 1.2 s there watching Kellner #1; then walking-only (a QA beam search in
# 4-frame chunks that never takes a hurt): the hat shelf, Kellner #2's tray
# (548), the Selfie-Tourist (650) and the Kurgast (669) in pen C, Vitrine D
# (stand 0.7 s + 0.7 s); the chandelier route L3-L6 with a 40-frame stand on
